					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-341213#post-1198850</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-341213/and-then-i-died-archive#post-1198850</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 11 Jul 2011 12:08:05 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Voct</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>392303</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>and CondorTalon has won (in IRC).</p> <p>KickassFrog - don't feel bad about falling for the red herring. You're not the only one who did.</p> <p>The guy's comment about how 'maybe it's just the contrast with the hospital food' &#8212; that was correct. It <em>was</em> just the contrast with the hospital food. He'd been in the hospital to get a pacemaker inserted. And now the pacemaker is malfunctioning.</p> <p>And the fact that he was eating at the Last Chance Diner - there actually <em>are</em> diners called that.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
