					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The guy was <em>supposed</em> to read a script of some sort or else the guy behind the microphone would have him killed, or maybe SCP-███ reacts to the script being not read correctly or whatever. The only problem was that the fanfic plague had messed up with the printout, so the narrator started reading gibberish instead of the script, and <em>that's</em> what got him killed.</p> <p>I do agree with Dexanote that maybe I was a bit too clever. I won though :D</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
